B.ag5=s(["This week slipped. New case Monday.","This week\u2019s file is thin. Fresh one soon.","Not your week. Next one\u2019s blank.","Case reopens Monday. I\u2019ll be there.","Clean page Monday. I\u2019ve got a pen."],t.s)
B.acz=s(["No proof all week. Suspicious.","The week left. So did your alibi.","Week\u2019s over. Evidence: missing.","I watched all week. Nothing.","Even the night shift saw more of you.","My clipboard is empty. So is your case.","I blew the whistle. Nobody came."],t.s)
B.agx=s(["A whole week, no proof. Damn.","Ghosts have better attendance.","A full week? Hell of an absence.","Damn. Your alibi fell apart.","Where the fuck were you all week?","I wrote \u201cabsent\u201d so many damn times."],t.s)
