B.ar8=new A.fO("Join a squad of 2 to 13. Everyone sees who showed up today, and who didn\u2019t.","Train with friends\nwho notice.")
B.aqN=new A.fO("At any gym: a photo when you arrive and another 30 to 60 minutes later, both GPS-tagged. At home: one photo of you training.","Proof, not\npromises.")
B.apU=new A.fO("Cheer their proof, nudge whoever hasn\u2019t trained, and vote on freezes. Anyone can flag a fake.","Your squad has\nyour back.")
B.aq4=new A.fO("Five buttons at the bottom. The big one in the middle is the one you\u2019ll use most.","Finding your\nway around.")
B.aqv=new A.fO("Train any days you like. Hit your number by Sunday and the streak grows, and so does your buddy. Freezes cover sick days and travel.","A streak you\ncan\u2019t fake.")
