B.afV=s(["{n} days. Hm. Keep doing that.","{n} days straight. I\u2019ve stopped eating.","{n} in a row. Now I\u2019m paying attention.","Day {n}. You might be serious.","{n} days. Respect. Quietly.","Streak {n}. I told no one. I\u2019m proud.","{n} days. Both eyebrows are up.","Day {n}. Veteran behaviour."],t.s)
B.agS=s(["Every day counts now. You got this.","No days to spare. One charge at a time.","Every session matters now. Head down.","Tight week. You can still make it."],t.s)
B.a8b=s(["Gym. Today. I will not ask nicely.","Couch 1, you 0. Charge it.","No more rest days. The gate\u2019s open.","Today\u2019s not optional. Go.","See that excuse? Run through it.","I\u2019m pawing the ground. Move."],t.s)
B.abi=s(["Get your ass to the gym. Today.","Fucking hell. Now or never.","Move it. Damn week\u2019s almost gone.","Up. Gym. Now. No damn excuses.","I\u2019ll drag your ass there myself.","Charge, damn it. CHARGE."],t.s)
