B.aa_=s(["Lower the bar to the middle of your chest, elbows about 45 degrees from your sides.","Touch lightly, then press up and slightly back toward your face.","Keep your backside on the bench and your wrists over your elbows."],t.s)
B.a4_=new A.bX("Chest, shoulders, triceps","Lie with your eyes under the bar, feet flat, shoulder blades pulled back and down. Grip a little wider than your shoulders.",B.aa_,"Bouncing the bar off your chest, or flaring the elbows straight out. Lift heavy sets with a spotter or inside a rack with safeties.")
B.ae1=s(["Lower the bar to your upper chest, just under the collarbones.","Press straight up until your arms are straight.","Keep your chest up the whole way."],t.s)
B.a4B=new A.bX("Upper chest, shoulders, triceps","Set the bench to about 30 degrees. Shoulder blades back, feet flat, grip a little wider than your shoulders.",B.ae1,"Setting the bench too steep: past about 45 degrees it becomes a shoulder press.")
B.aci=s(["Press up until your arms are straight, dumbbells over your shoulders.","Lower slowly until your elbows are just below the bench (or your upper arms touch the floor).","Keep your shoulder blades pinned back."],t.s)
B.a4u=new A.bX("Chest, shoulders, triceps","Sit with the dumbbells on your thighs, lie back and bring them to your chest. On the floor, start with your upper arms resting down.",B.aci,"Letting the dumbbells drift apart at the bottom faster than you can control.")
B.ahd=s(["Press up and slightly in until your arms are straight.","Lower over two to three seconds to a deep stretch.","Keep your elbows under your wrists."],t.s)
B.a4A=new A.bX("Upper chest, shoulders","Bench at about 30 degrees. Dumbbells at your shoulders, palms forward.",B.ahd,"Arching hard to turn it back into a flat press.")
B.abX=s(["Press out until your arms are nearly straight.","Come back slowly until you feel a stretch across the chest."],t.s)
B.a4m=new A.bX("Chest, shoulders, triceps","Set the seat so the handles line up with the middle of your chest. Back flat on the pad.",B.abX,"Letting the weight stack slam: keep tension at the bottom.")
B.ahW=s(["Sweep your hands together in front of your chest in a wide arc.","Squeeze for a moment, then open slowly to a stretch.","Keep the bend in your elbows the same throughout."],t.s)
B.a4x=new A.bX("Chest","Pulleys at about shoulder height. Step forward with one foot, a soft bend in the elbows.",B.ahW,"Bending and straightening the arms so it turns into a press.")
B.abv=s(["Open your arms wide until you feel a stretch across the chest.","Bring them back together along the same arc."],t.s)
B.a4R=new A.bX("Chest","Lie back with the dumbbells above your chest, palms facing, elbows slightly bent. On the floor is fine: the floor limits the depth.",B.abv,"Going heavy. This is a light, controlled movement; too deep with too much weight strains the shoulder.")
B.adX=s(["Lower your chest to just above the floor, elbows about 45 degrees out.","Push the floor away until your arms are straight.","Squeeze your glutes so your hips don\u2019t sag."],t.s)
B.a4E=new A.bX("Chest, shoulders, triceps, core","Hands a little wider than your shoulders, body in one straight line from head to heels. Feet on a bench makes it harder.",B.adX,"Hips sagging or head reaching for the floor. Too hard? Put your hands on a bench.")
B.acN=s(["Lower until your upper arms are about level with the floor.","Press back up without locking out hard."],t.s)
B.a4t=new A.bX("Chest, triceps, shoulders","Support yourself on the bars with straight arms. Lean forward a little for chest, stay upright for triceps.",B.acN,"Dropping too deep with your shoulders rolling forward. Stop where your shoulders stay comfortable.")
B.ahT=s(["Lower until your elbows are at about a right angle.","Press back up, keeping your back close to the bench."],t.s)
B.a4M=new A.bX("Triceps, shoulders","Hands on the edge of a bench behind you, fingers forward, legs out in front (bent knees is easier).",B.ahT,"Sinking too low or letting your shoulders roll forward.")
B.a8o=s(["Lower the top of your head toward the floor in front of your hands.","Press back up to straight arms."],t.s)
B.a48=new A.bX("Shoulders, triceps","From a push-up position, walk your feet in and lift your hips so your body makes an upside-down V.",B.a8o,"Letting the hips drop so it becomes a normal push-up.")
B.aaU=s(["Take a breath, brace your stomach, and push the floor away.","Keep the bar against your legs all the way up.","Stand tall, then lower it the same way: hips back first."],t.s)
B.a4e=new A.bX("Back, glutes, hamstrings","Feet hip-width with the bar over the middle of your feet. Bend down and grip just outside your legs, shins touching the bar, back flat, chest up.",B.aaU,"Rounding your lower back, or jerking the bar off the floor. If your back rounds, the weight is too heavy.")
B.agc=s(["Pull the bar to your lower ribs, elbows going back.","Squeeze your shoulder blades together, then lower under control."],t.s)
B.a4U=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Hinge forward at the hips until your torso is about 45 degrees or lower, back flat, knees soft. Grip just wider than your legs.",B.agc,"Standing up with each rep to heave the weight.")
B.adA=s(["Pull your elbows down toward your hips until your chin clears the bar.","Lower all the way to straight arms."],t.s)
B.a4g=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Hang from the bar with your palms facing away, hands a little wider than your shoulders.",B.adA,"Half reps. Can\u2019t do one yet? Use a band, or jump up and lower slowly.")
B.agd=s(["Pull until your chin is over the bar, chest up.","Lower all the way to straight arms."],t.s)
B.a4L=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Hang from the bar with your palms facing you, hands shoulder-width.",B.agd,"Kicking or swinging to get up.")
B.aaZ=s(["Pull the bar to your upper chest, elbows down and back.","Let it rise slowly until your arms are straight."],t.s)
B.a4T=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Thighs snug under the pads, grip a little wider than your shoulders, lean back slightly.",B.aaZ,"Leaning far back and pulling with your body weight.")
B.ady=s(["Pull the handle to your stomach, elbows close to your sides.","Squeeze your shoulder blades together.","Reach forward again without rounding your lower back."],t.s)
B.a4y=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Feet on the plate, knees soft, sit tall with your arms straight.",B.ady,"Rocking back and forth to move the weight.")
B.agM=s(["Pull the dumbbell to your hip, elbow going back and up.","Lower until your arm is straight and your shoulder blade stretches."],t.s)
B.a4G=new A.bX("Back, biceps","One hand and knee on a bench (or a hand on a chair), back flat, the dumbbell hanging under your shoulder.",B.agM,"Twisting your torso open to lift it higher.")
B.a99=s(["Row the handles or dumbbells toward your hips.","Pause with your shoulder blades squeezed, then lower."],t.s)
B.a42=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Lie chest-down on an incline bench or the machine pad, arms hanging straight.",B.a99,"Lifting your chest off the pad to finish the rep.")
B.ahR=s(["Pull your chest to the bar.","Lower to straight arms, body still in one line."],t.s)
B.a4N=new A.bX("Back, biceps","Lie under a bar set at about waist height (or a sturdy table edge), grip it, body straight, heels on the floor.",B.ahR,"Hips sagging. Bend your knees to make it easier.")
B.agI=s(["Pull the rope toward your face, hands going apart and elbows high.","Finish with your hands beside your ears, then return slowly."],t.s)
B.a40=new A.bX("Rear shoulders, upper back","Rope on a pulley at about face height (or a band at the same height). Step back, arms straight.",B.agI,"Using too much weight and leaning back to move it.")
