B.abp=s(["Press straight up, moving your head back out of the way.","Finish with the bar over the middle of your feet, arms locked.","Lower to your upper chest under control."],t.s)
B.a47=new A.bX("Shoulders, triceps","Bar on your upper chest, grip just outside your shoulders, feet hip-width, glutes and stomach tight.",B.abp,"Leaning back to turn it into a standing incline press.")
