B.ahC=s(["Press up to nearly straight arms.","Lower slowly."],t.s)
B.a4w=new A.bX("Shoulders, triceps","Seat set so the handles start level with your shoulders, back against the pad.",B.ahC,"Starting with the handles too low, which strains the shoulder.")
B.aes=s(["Raise your arms out to the sides until they\u2019re level with your shoulders.","Lead with your elbows, not your hands.","Lower over two seconds."],t.s)
